; displayexclusive.eval - exclusive full-screen taken away and given back
; (code-review C194). JUDGED by `tools\DisplayTest.py --exclusive` ONLY, never
; from CheckAll: it SWITCHES A MONITOR to exclusive full-screen for a few
; seconds, so it is run when nobody is using that screen.
;
;   enter     `video apply exclusive` on the staged monitor at its own mode.
;   drop      what Alt+Tab does: the state goes behind the device's back. The
;             next frame must find it and rebuild the back buffers before it
;             presents - the abort this batch fixes - and the frames after present.
;   activate  coming back posts WM_ACTIVATEAPP; the game re-enters the Exclusive
;             the drop took, at the top of the next frame.
;
; Every apply here is a script's, so nothing is saved; it ends Windowed.
newgame
video apply exclusive native
video status
video drop
echo dropped-frame-1
echo dropped-frame-2
echo dropped-frame-3
video status
video activate
echo reentered-wait
echo reentered
video status
video apply windowed 1280x720
